# niri
Add this line inside the `binds { }` section of ~/.config/niri/config.kdl. niri reloads it automatically.

Ctrl+Alt+C { spawn "/home/you/Applications/QuickTranslate-x86_64.AppImage" "--toggle"; }
---
# niri
Add this line inside the `binds { }` section of ~/.config/niri/config.kdl. niri reloads it automatically.

Ctrl+Alt+C { spawn "quick-translate" "--toggle"; }
---
# niri
Add this line inside the `binds { }` section of ~/.config/niri/config.kdl. niri reloads it automatically.

Ctrl+Alt+C { spawn "/home/you/My Apps/Quick Translate's.AppImage" "--toggle"; }
